WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The robot arm approaches the blue rectangular object on the table from above, grasps it, and lifts it. The arm then moves the object to the right and places it onto the small round bowl.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
move to the blue object

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.000
grasp the blue object

4
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
lift the blue object

5
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.500
move the blue object to the bowl

6
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.000
release the blue object on the bowl
